The recognition runtime in oxr_runtime/ reimplements the OXR-1.0 model following
its reference implementation (modeling_oxr.py and the vLLM plugin published with
the OXR-1.0 model). At run time it loads the OXR-1.0 weights and uses the OXR
source tree (the oxr package and services/layout_analyze). Neither the OXR source
tree nor the OXR-1.0 weights are included in this repository.

Container images built from this repository's Dockerfile also contain the OXR
source tree, the OXR-1.0 weights and third-party software under their own
licenses; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and /licenses in the image.

